                                                "sense_id": "df28d279-6acc-3b63-bba4-b728b6d78391",
                                                "text": "Coal and petroleum do not occur hap-hazard in nature, but the aggregate occurrence of each product in any region forms a definite, limited horizon, which, in its continuance, is independent of the bedding plane."
